<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-078" chapter-id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei" source-id="s-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei">
  <p id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:ding" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:ding:m0000" ref="o9i_f7k_d6z">丁潭</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:ding:m0004" ref="o9i_f7k_d6z">世康</persName>，會稽山陰人也。祖<persName id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:ding:m0015" ref="uxk_94s_ndu">固</persName>，吳司徒。父<persName id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:ding:m0022" ref="uxk_94s_ndu_A">彌</persName>，梁州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:kong" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:kong:m0000" ref="f84_da6_42a">孔愉</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:kong:m0004" ref="f84_da6_42a">敬康</persName>，會稽山陰人也。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:judgment" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:judgment:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">王導</persName>嘗謂<persName id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:judgment:m0004" ref="f84_da6_42a">孔敬康</persName>有公才而無公望，<persName id="c-jinshu-078-jin076-yufei:judgment:m0015" ref="o9i_f7k_d6z">丁世康</persName>有公望而無公才。</p>
</text>
